---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Engineering Notes
description: Short, practical observations on electronics, PCB design, and the decisions behind reliable hardware.
permalink: /notes/
---

<section class="archive-header shell">
  <a class="back-link" href="/">← Home</a>
  <p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Archive</p>
  <h1>Engineering notes.</h1>
  <p>Short investigations into electronics, PCB design, and the manufacturing decisions that make hardware behave in the real world.</p>
</section>

<section class="archive-list shell">
  {% for note in collections.notes %}
  <article class="archive-row">
    <time datetime="{{ note.date | isoDate }}">{{ note.date | readableDate }}</time>
    <div><p class="note-kind">{{ note.data.tags[0] or "Engineering" }}</p><h2><a href="{{ note.url }}">{{ note.data.title }}</a></h2><p class="note-excerpt">{{ note.data.description }}</p></div>
    <a class="arrow-link" href="{{ note.url }}" aria-label="Read {{ note.data.title }}">↗</a>
  </article>
  {% else %}
  <p class="empty-state">No notes published yet.</p>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
